> **Repository:** https://github.com/StackDs/Basic-C-Without-Tears
> **License:** CC BY 4.0
> **License:** https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

If the material has been modified, translated, adapted, or otherwise
changed, the attribution should also indicate that modifications were made.

Example:

